---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Greg O'Brien" current={-1}>
<div data-screen-label="Home">
<div data-hero="1" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--edge);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:38px">
<div data-hero-left="1" style="padding:96px 56px 84px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Greg O'Brien</div>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:54px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em">I'm a product manager<br>and a <span style="font-style:italic">maker</span>.</h1>
</div>
<div data-hero-right="1" style="padding:calc(96px + 32.5px) 56px 84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch;color:var(--body)">Over a decade in AI and digital innovation, after studying product and philosophy. My day job is building enterprise AI agents at Mastercard. On the side, I build my own, and think about how AI should be developed safely and ethically.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)"><span>Based in Dublin</span><span>·</span><a href="#" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .2s ease" class="h-ul">Email</a><a href="#" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none" class="h-ul">LinkedIn</a></div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:44px 56px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Build</span>
<a href="/build" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">All work →</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:14px 56px 52px">
<a href="/build/stackchan" style="display:block;border:1px solid var(--edge);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9;background:var(--tileA);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--tileAInk);letter-spacing:.08em">[ STACKCHAN PHOTO ]</span></div>
<div style="padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px">
<div><div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600">Stackchan</div><p style="margin:7px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--body);max-width:70ch">An ESP32 desktop companion robot, currently getting taught to have opinions — an experiment in giving an LLM a face and a personality.</p></div>
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap">Personal · Hardware</span>
</div>
</a>
</div>

<div data-pair="1" style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:linear-gradient(var(--rule),var(--rule)) 50% 0/1px 100% no-repeat">
<div style="padding:40px 56px 48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Watch</span>
<a href="/watch" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">All videos →</a>
</div>
<a href="/watch" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;margin-top:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--edge);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="flex:none;aspect-ratio:16 / 9;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:18px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)">[ VIDEO THUMBNAIL ]</span></div>
<div style="flex:1;padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge)">
<div style="min-height:2.5em;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25">"What actually makes something an agent?"</div>
<p style="margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body);max-width:52ch">A plain-language look at agents, autonomy, and where the hype gets ahead of the reality.</p>
</div>
</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:40px 56px 48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Think</span>
<a href="/think" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">All notes →</a>
</div>
<a href="/think/jev-and-the-case-for-a-model-that-doesnt-talk" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;margin-top:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--edge);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="flex:none;aspect-ratio:16 / 9;padding:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#68c8f0"><img src="/images/think/jev-hero.webp" alt="A fountain pen whose nib has drawn a single small tick on an otherwise empty page" width="1344" height="768" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:right center;display:block" /></div>
<div style="flex:1;padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge)">
<div style="min-height:2.5em;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25">Jev and the case for a model that doesn't talk</div>
<p style="margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body);max-width:52ch">Most of an agent's work is small judgement calls. TypeSafe has built a model for exactly that, and I think the idea is bigger than the product.</p>
</div>
</a>
</div>
</div>

<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:56px 56px 34px">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Stream</span>
<a href="/stream" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">All entries →</a>
</div>
<div data-stream-grid="1" style="margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:56px">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 15</span><span>Leadership begins where explanation becomes recommendation.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 11</span><span>Ownership sounds like a decision followed by a next step.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 08</span><span>Complexity is real, but it does not excuse confusion.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 04</span><span>Simplicity is often the final result of difficult thinking.</span></div>
</div>
</div>

<div data-split="1" style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:40px 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start">
<div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Meet</span>
<a href="/meet" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">About me →</a>
</div>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">I like meeting other makers and thinkers, and talking about the things we're building. If that sounds like your world too, if you need someone for a stage, or think I'd be useful for a project you're working on, please reach out.</p>
</div>
<div style="border:1px solid var(--edge);padding:26px;background:var(--surface)">
<div style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:24px">Get in touch</div>
<p style="margin:10px 0 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)">Happy to talk about agents, product, or anything half-built.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px"><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);transition:opacity .2s ease" class="h-dim">Email</a><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px 14px;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--edge);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">LinkedIn</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
